     _s_t_r_u_c_t _k_i_n_f_o___p_r_o_c structures as defined by <_s_y_s_/_u_s_e_r_._h>.  The pointer was
     obtained by an internal call to malloc(3) and must be freed by the caller
     with a call to free(3).  On failure the kkiinnffoo__ggeettaallllpprroocc() function re‐
     turns NULL.

